		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Man-sized white maggot that burrows into corpses and animates them like a bloated, corpulent flesh suit. Spawned from necrophiles and body desecrators.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 10, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 longsword +1 (1d8, host) or 1 bite +1 (1d4, worm form), <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow, worm form), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Inhabit Body</strong>. As an action, can crawl out of or into mortal corpse. Devour insides, use body like a bloated, unwieldy puppet.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
